# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/reduction-fission-host-adapter.py %S/../../utils/check-reduction-fission.py --emit-ir | opt -passes=verify -disable-output

# Parser/lowering regressions, including malformed IR that must be rejected
# before host code generation. The second RUN verifies all executable probe IR.
# Executable bitwise lane comparisons are mandatory in the full
# llvm/utils/check-reduction-fission.py run: the independent C oracle indexes
# input[factor*lane+member], never the adapter's generated masks. These probes
# complement every existing original-scalar/transformed-fission comparison.
